            "review_title": "Review at iSushi",
            "review_text": "Mari K\n90 contributions\n0\nProblems with ordering\nSep 2018 • Couples\nI really, really wanted to like this place. Food was good and menus were nice. \n\nbut from the beginning they forgot our orders. Approximately 2/3 they forgot. We asked about our orders and had to order several times again. We had language barrier example some incridients were out and still promised to us. \n\nI feel bad for the waitresses/waitress. They were really trying and i believe there is something wrong with their system hoe they keep on track with tables and orders. \n\nPlus in the bill there u have to pay extra on napkin and WAT. \n\nIdea about fresh buffee is nice tho\nRead more\nWritten September 9, 2018\nGolden Gate Restaurant Group\nHello Mari K! We are so sorry for your bad experience at iSushi. We will send your comment to our Manager to improve our Service. Could you please send us your email address so we can keep in touch with you? We are looking forward to your feedback\nRead more\nWritten September 13, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
